# Terraform Provider Configuration

## AWS Provider

**Basic Configuration**
```hcl
terraform {
  required_providers {
    aws = {
      source  = "hashicorp/aws"
      version = "~> 5.0"
    }
  }
}

provider "aws" {
  region = var.aws_region

  default_tags {
    tags = {
      Environment = var.environment
      ManagedBy   = "Terraform"
      Project     = var.project_name
    }
  }
}
```

